  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a53188bb00f310268fef735b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但稻荷一说要以成就来展现决心，\n所以也不打算向师傅解释。\n这样真的好吗？训练员感到不安。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e3b183e5ef3b02f3697a07aa4c7772693101f394c4f2ffbdf6253fe29153ca4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1034/storytimeline_501034402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f739f187a637299dd1ed1c1f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "嘴上说说没有意义",
      "source_fingerprint": "6c034b44ce511af4e620ac5017303fa1d755758e68ae7cdaf3bce8d54b621407",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1034/storytimeline_501034402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fbe00bf509ce4cd44d78ae5b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了不枉费稻荷一对大井的心意，\n训练员去见了稻荷一的师傅，\n告诉他跑地方比赛的真正用意与她的目标。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a7cbe40c4e64be363dde5e0c6739e365faf856b2e092157e2d1b3be983080cfa",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1034/storytimeline_501034403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e41d416de2095667cc7b1a0f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "师傅听完后来到了特雷森学园，\n抱怨稻荷一为何没向他们宣告，\n她要以地方的“巅峰”为目标。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3aaea4d403408c9eb935d5f8c12b8c0598e1cb5d0770c20bd0ad014afb19599a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1034/storytimeline_501034403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:46f642020ead3b92861bbf1b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "并激励了她，要她抬头挺胸地挑战爬上\n“巅峰”的大战，不能胆怯。",
      "source_fingerprint": "efa367e92a2500e8303fdc14c15fbf427fdc423eebb0a90dfaaddc12ee637f02",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1034/storytimeline_501034403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b3e7a99bb1471e6083f93c3a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "稻荷一宣告她要爬上地方的“巅峰”。\n解开了与师傅的误会，\n并且当面向大井选手们宣战。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e61af6d831234ae391d006e0b62eba8006846755845f2a41c8050c7ba407fa5b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1034/storytimeline_501034403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d185e8de7cfdee42469affa",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "一个人是办不了祭典的",
      "source_fingerprint": "a01b37ea51e66a6c8b2b4ff71c5892fc90168998d7c44683bcb827b872896bad",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1034/storytimeline_501034403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4bf18984d43d9931a8a06b5c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1034/storytimeline_501034404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c10a42803de2f7e2c8daaeff",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "世人的话题都围绕在小栗帽与玉藻十字\n即将同场竞技的“有马纪念”上。",
      "source_fingerprint": "861a979e07187d6236a093571b5e86b9c9bffc5c2626ae18de7084ccaa22eacd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1034/storytimeline_501034404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b9f5accac085958bbe6e572",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1034/storytimeline_501034404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:217a66d50899c80b9382433a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "此外，在“菊花赏”跑得令人印象深刻的\n超级溪流也备受瞩目。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d70efe24bedfa60e5003a8b42e796df99625f60b4c1f88860ababa3fd998f6e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1034/storytimeline_501034404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:141934b808bcc7556584ffa2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1034/storytimeline_501034404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b095b8646a4bbbd07e36e5cf",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "稻荷一从这些劲敌身上，\n感受到将在同场比赛上碰头的“缘”，\n以及注定会成为盛大祭典的“宿命”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "926eaccd454cc69a6b570786161028dbb99c1a839c013f8f1c33b054a2a38b78",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1034/storytimeline_501034404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:92117ab81b3915146a20a404",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1034/storytimeline_501034404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d211b1b9e012ed1488100a27",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她虽然很想\n快点到古马级与小栗帽等人比赛，\n但在那之前，今年有必须拿下的成就。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ce4e6a4e2b99f2a1b8bb19cd76401dbd430c11c73d0cf8692c2773d77490119",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1034/storytimeline_501034404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe878495517f649f47c4c8f7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1034/storytimeline_501034404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81cda76141f27a7e46ef71dd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了能够以地方“巅峰”之姿前往古马级，\n她以“东京大赏典”为目标，\n开始进行最后的调整。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3d75baf81dcd770a65d72c360e98a6d6c18e11b795dcaeeb6ee568416b22e2f1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1034/storytimeline_501034404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8c64bf773b5c0f0c4e6d4043",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": " “缘分”与“宿命”的花道",
      "source_fingerprint": "e506e4d15c0539147eb4d57b1a4bdde19ba8a329390199c46dcdc8d02740acf3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1034/storytimeline_501034404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a8b065d3bebf13e01778500",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "稻荷一开始在宿舍静养后又过了几天。\n故乡人们为了祈求她早日康复，\n办了一场祭典并邀请她过来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e1851bc93c1de331f814f2a34ddddbf8936ac0453efc383db29796619a99012",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1034/storytimeline_501034405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab72dc011f43a8645655c71d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "受到大井乡亲的激励后，\n稻荷一发现自己因为太在乎别人，\n变得一心只想要赢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e6606e9ae321f3aab24d7fe6c82bffcf88592e99c4ed0a80d2254e53c633fe6f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1034/storytimeline_501034405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5d3e76cd874c66c0de560204",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但这场较量是属于自己的，\n要爬上“巅峰”的也是自己。",
      "source_fingerprint": "09c557868586e068b69f10b10eb3aabca72dcc7ba77f058e225297a2b7e61f02",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1034/storytimeline_501034405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:26db6dbd014fdb20d632be0a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "身为祭典主办人，自己得先感到快乐，\n较量也得是为了自己，不然就没意义了。\n过去稻荷一忘记了这件事。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c80046d45444911da90fe3df7074501ae6b5864b335ed159e3f95699043991fb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1034/storytimeline_501034405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d32693e9839953cb13fae6e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "稻荷一恢复到原来的状态后，\n为了让“有马纪念”成为最棒的祭典，\n再次向前迈进。",
      "source_fingerprint": "867abb2fda02a3947f72ff9ed81371961c14bbdd8fd388b8fdc705d9c2c3aa2b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1034/storytimeline_501034405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:42fa4870f0dd8e1053973f06",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那就是祭典之心“潇洒”",
      "source_fingerprint": "e5bd1b4ce7d2f7ffc57cc3542846b886c2c0c9916f2088d6605203a143ac67e0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1034/storytimeline_501034405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f3dca400e6ff37968191714f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1034/storytimeline_501034406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3279e4397c4047b0fcdf12da",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "夏季集训从今天开始，\n但稻荷一预定于这段期间内\n参赛“日本沙土德比”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e6b29b2611358f3e63d4c2337baa51e6ca4ee5a142e3c71752ea41ca88386cfc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1034/storytimeline_501034406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ca1268d2133740feb63f711",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1034/storytimeline_501034406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b6745d80cf02d3d3d85eba64",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她发誓一定要在大井赛场跑出好成绩\n再回来继续集训。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b0b7bda72d65694fed8890888f143c0e697a97011ea5ab6de8dfb2aa2049226f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1034/storytimeline_501034406.json",
